  "historyNote": "#7152, eff 12-10-99 (formerly Tax 101.13); ss by #7875, eff 4-18-03); ss by #8985, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 102.13); ss by #9537, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 102.14); ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
