  "prefLabel": "Tax 102.12 Costs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 102.12 “Costs” means all fees, witness fees, attorney’s fees, and expenses awardable by the board pursuant to RSA 21-J:28-b, VI, RSA 71-B:9, RSA 76:16-a, RSA 76:17-b, RSA 498-A:9-a, and 9-b, and RSA 498-A:26-a, and 26-b.\n\nSource. #7152, eff 12-10-99 (formerly Tax 101.13); ss by #7875, eff 4-18-03); ss by #8985, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 102.13); ss by #9537, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 102.14); ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
